![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)

The loop performs a linear scan `procedureInstances.find(...)` for each entry in `procedureStepsByInstance`, resulting in O(N * M) complexity. This can be optimized to O(N + M) by mapping `procedureInstances` to a Map by `procedure_instance_id` beforehand.

Please optimize this linear scan to improve performance and maintainability.

```javascript
  const instanceMap = new Map(
    procedureInstances.map((inst) => [inst.procedure_instance_id, inst])
  );
  const stepOrderFailures = [];
  for (const [instanceId, group] of procedureStepsByInstance.entries()) {
    const ordered = [...group].sort((left, right) => compareByteOrder(left.step_index, right.step_index));
    const indices = ordered.map((stepItem) => stepItem.step_index);
    for (let index = 0; index < indices.length; index += 1) {
      if (indices[index] !== index) {
        stepOrderFailures.push({
          scope: instanceId,
          code: 'non_consecutive_step_order',
          observed: indices[index],
          expected: index,
        });
        break;
      }
    }
    const instance = instanceMap.get(instanceId);
```

